    "value": "We're actively investigating this issue and hope to have a proper fix implemented in a future update.\nIn the meantime, as a temporary workaround, you may want to consider disabling IPv6 which has resolved this issue for other users. You can do this by following the process on this site: https://contenthub.streamlabs.com/content-hub/post/how-to-solve-ipv6-issues\nIf you are using Oculus Quest in standalone you will need to look into disabling it in your router.",
